<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS NOT REVIEWING POLYGRAM TIES.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS NOT REVIEWING POLYGRAM TIES.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV chairman Cor Boonstra said on Thursday the company was not reviewing its relationship with its 75 percent owned recorded music and film unit PolyGram NV.</p>
<p>&quot;There is not going to be an announcement, nor is there going to be an evaluation, about the relationship between Philips and Polygram,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
